86 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 57 0 R/T(I\220m Leanne, mum of two, \(and a cocker spaniel, Ron\) Doula, Perinatal Yoga teacher and Birth Trauma Resolution practitioner, and obviously a hypnobirthing nerd! )/E(I\220m Leanne, mum of two, \(and a cocker spaniel, Ron\) Doula, Perinatal Yoga teacher and Birth Trauma Resolution practitioner, and obviously a hypnobirthing nerd! )/Pg 10 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

87 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 57 0 R/T(When you become pregnant, for the first, or the fifth time, your mindset changes instantly, as well as being excited, it can be overwhelming and full of uncertainty.  Especially if you\220re told you need to be induced... but what does this mean? What options do you have? How will this be done? Oh the questions!!)/E(When you become pregnant, for the first, or the fifth time, your mindset changes instantly, as well as being excited, it can be overwhelming and full of uncertainty.  Especially if you\220re told you need to be induced... but what does this mean? What options do you have? How will this be done? Oh the questions!!)/Pg 10 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

88 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 57 0 R/T(It can be daunting when you don\220t have the answers to this, so here is a guide to help you understand the processes, what your rights and options are as well as how to make it more posiitive if you choose to accept one.)/E(It can be daunting when you don\220t have the answers to this, so here is a guide to help you understand the processes, what your rights and options are as well as how to make it more posiitive if you choose to accept one.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

89 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 57 0 R/T(If you have any questions, please don\220t hesitate to contact me.)/E(If you have any questions, please don\220t hesitate to contact me.)/Pg 10 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

